---
import BackToTop from '../../components/BackToTop.astro';
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';

const title = 'EventStorming Services - Virtual Genius';
const description = 'Three ways to work with Paul on EventStorming: facilitated workshops on your domain, a facilitator program that builds capability inside your team, or public workshops for individual practitioners.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
	</head>
	<body class="bg-white">
		<Header />

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden" style="height: 360px;">
			<div class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full">
				<img
					src="/images/eventstorming-wall.webp"
					alt="EventStorming wall with sticky notes"
					class="w-full h-full object-cover"
					style="filter: brightness(0.6); object-position: center 40%;"
				/>
				<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/40 via-black/30 to-black/50"></div>
			</div>

			<div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center h-full">
				<div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6 w-full">
					<div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
						<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">
							EventStorming Services
						</h1>
						<p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4 text-white/95 drop-shadow-md">
							Three ways to work with Paul, depending on the outcome you want
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- What is EventStorming? (short intro) -->
		<Section>
			<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6 text-vg-burgundy">What Is EventStorming?</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-vg-gray-dark mb-4">
					A rapid, collaborative workshop format that brings business experts and technical teams together to explore complex domains. Using colored sticky notes on a long wall, participants model business processes as sequences of domain events, uncovering insights and identifying opportunities for improvement.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-vg-gray-dark">
					Paul has been facilitating and teaching EventStorming since 2017 and has guided dozens of organizations through the method.
				</p>
			</div>
		</Section>

		<!-- Pick your path -->
		<Section background="gray">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-center text-vg-burgundy">What Outcome Do You Want?</h2>
				<p class="text-lg text-vg-gray-dark mb-12 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
					EventStorming can be a facilitated intervention on a specific problem, a way to build lasting capability inside your team, or a skill an individual practitioner wants to add. Each path is its own engagement shape.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
					<!-- Facilitated Workshops -->
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg border-t-4 border-vg-red overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full group hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow relative">
						<div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0">
							<img
								src="/images/bti360-eventstorming-collaboration-closeup.webp"
								alt="Paul facilitating an EventStorming workshop"
								class="w-full h-full object-cover"
							/>
						</div>
						<div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col relative">
							<p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-vg-red font-semibold">For a Specific Problem</p>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-vg-burgundy">
								<a href="/services/eventstorming/workshops" class="after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-vg-red transition-colors">
									Facilitated Workshops
								</a>
							</h3>
							<p class="text-vg-gray-dark mb-4 flex-grow">
								Paul facilitates on your domain. Your team walks away with shared understanding, identified pain points, and a prioritized roadmap. In-person, virtual, or hybrid, typically 2 days.
							</p>
							<p class="text-sm text-vg-gray mb-4">
								<strong>Best for:</strong> Legacy modernization, greenfield exploration, cross-functional alignment, strategy reviews
							</p>
							<span class="text-vg-red group-hover:text-vg-red-light font-semibold inline-flex items-center pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
								Learn More
								<svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
								</svg>
							</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Facilitator Program -->
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg border-t-4 border-vg-red overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full group hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow relative">
						<div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0">
							<img
								src="/images/bti360-team-standing-modeling.webp"
								alt="Cohort practicing EventStorming facilitation"
								class="w-full h-full object-cover"
							/>
						</div>
						<div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col relative">
							<p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-vg-red font-semibold">To Build Capability</p>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-vg-burgundy">
								<a href="/services/eventstorming/facilitator-program" class="after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-vg-red transition-colors">
									Facilitator Program
								</a>
							</h3>
							<p class="text-vg-gray-dark mb-4 flex-grow">
								A 3-day on-site training where your cohort learns the EventStorming curriculum on days 1 and 2, then facilitates on your own business processes on day 3. Ongoing support afterward as they take it into real engagements.
							</p>
							<p class="text-sm text-vg-gray mb-4">
								<strong>Best for:</strong> Consultancies, enablement teams, CoEs, platform teams who want a repeatable internal practice
							</p>
							<span class="text-vg-red group-hover:text-vg-red-light font-semibold inline-flex items-center pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
								Learn More
								<svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
								</svg>
							</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Public Workshop -->
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg border-t-4 border-vg-red overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full group hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow relative">
						<div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0">
							<img
								src="/images/virtual-workshop-zoom.webp"
								alt="Virtual EventStorming workshop"
								class="w-full h-full object-cover"
							/>
						</div>
						<div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex-grow flex flex-col relative">
							<p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-vg-red font-semibold">For Individual Practitioners</p>
							<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-vg-burgundy">
								<a href="/workshops/eventstorming" class="after:absolute after:inset-0 hover:text-vg-red transition-colors">
									Public Workshop
								</a>
							</h3>
							<p class="text-vg-gray-dark mb-4 flex-grow">
								A scheduled virtual workshop that teaches you the EventStorming facilitation method alongside other practitioners. Smallest commitment, fastest entry point.
							</p>
							<p class="text-sm text-vg-gray mb-4">
								<strong>Best for:</strong> Individual developers, architects, coaches, product managers learning the method for the first time
							</p>
							<span class="text-vg-red group-hover:text-vg-red-light font-semibold inline-flex items-center pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
								See Upcoming Dates
								<svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
								</svg>
							</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</Section>

		<!-- Not sure? -->
		<Section>
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-vg-amber/10 border-l-4 border-vg-amber p-8 rounded">
				<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-vg-burgundy">Not Sure Which One Fits?</h3>
				<p class="text-lg text-vg-gray-dark mb-4">
					A few quick rules of thumb:
				</p>
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-vg-gray-dark">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
						<span class="text-vg-red mt-1 flex-shrink-0">
							<Icon name="check" size="sm" />
						</span>
						<span>If you have a specific business problem or legacy system you need to untangle, start with a <a href="/services/eventstorming/workshops" class="text-vg-red hover:underline font-semibold">facilitated workshop</a>.</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
						<span class="text-vg-red mt-1 flex-shrink-0">
							<Icon name="check" size="sm" />
						</span>
						<span>If you want EventStorming to be something your team can keep doing without Paul in the room, start with the <a href="/services/eventstorming/facilitator-program" class="text-vg-red hover:underline font-semibold">facilitator program</a>.</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
						<span class="text-vg-red mt-1 flex-shrink-0">
							<Icon name="check" size="sm" />
						</span>
						<span>If you want to try the method yourself before bringing it to your team, start with the <a href="/workshops/eventstorming" class="text-vg-red hover:underline font-semibold">public workshop</a>.</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2">
						<span class="text-vg-red mt-1 flex-shrink-0">
							<Icon name="check" size="sm" />
						</span>
						<span>Still unsure? <a href="/contact" class="text-vg-red hover:underline font-semibold">Get in touch</a> and we will figure it out together.</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</Section>

		<!-- CTA -->
		<Section background="burgundy">
			<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Ready to Get Started?</h2>
				<p class="text-xl mb-8 text-vg-gray-light">
					Tell us about your team, your domain, and what you are trying to accomplish. We will help you pick the right shape.
				</p>
				<Button href="/contact" variant="primary" class="!px-8 !py-4 !bg-white !text-vg-burgundy hover:!bg-vg-gray-light">
					Schedule a Planning Call
				</Button>
			</div>
		</Section>

		<BackToTop />
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
